Derived files (see file headers for details):
- src/providers/netflix/types.ts    — Netflix private-API response type shapes
                                      (from src/services/netflix/NetflixApi.ts)
- src/providers/netflix/api.ts      — endpoint URLs, request format, header values,
                                      metadata URL fallback order
                                      (from src/services/netflix/NetflixApi.ts)
- src/providers/netflix/parser.ts   — progress calculation formula and
                                      season/episode metadata matching logic
                                      (from src/services/netflix/NetflixProgress.ts
                                       and NetflixApi.ts)
- src/providers/prime/*.ts       — Prime Video endpoint URLs, region resolution,
                                    history flattening, metadata interpretation
                                    (from src/services/amazon-prime/AmazonPrimeApi.ts)
- src/providers/max/*.ts         — episode/movie shaping intuition only; the
                                    historic token-exchange/markers flow
                                    (src/services/hbo-max/HboMaxApi.ts) no longer
                                    applies to the rebranded Max web API
- src/providers/disney/*.ts      — DOM continue-watching scraping approach
                                    (from src/services/disneyplus/DisneyplusParser.ts)
- src/providers/apple/*.ts       — Apple TV umc.cmc content-id/route shapes and
                                    "SxEy" title parsing (from src/services/apple-tv/AppleTvParser.ts)

